{
  "id": "asoxChkMetrics01",
  "name": "chk-metrics",
  "active": true,
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## chk-metrics (contract check C11)\n**Trigger:** POST /webhook/chk-metrics from scripts/contracts-check.sh, header `X-ASOX-Token` required (credential \"ASOX webhook token\"; 403 without it).\n**Inputs:** `{\"step\": \"write\", \"id\": \"contract-check-...\"}` or `{\"step\": \"delete\", \"id\": \"contract-check-...\"}`. Any other step, or an id not starting with `contract-check-` (letters, digits, `.`, `_`, `:`, `-`; max 128), is answered HTTP 400 without calling the indexer.\n**Actions taken:** with the \"Wazuh indexer (n8n-indexer)\" credential, certificate verified (root CA via NODE_EXTRA_CA_CERTS): *write* upserts `asox-metrics` document `<id>` (`alert_id` = id, `outcome: contract-check`, `t_event` = `t_alert` = now; template fields only, strict mapping) and answers `{status, id}`; *delete* reads the document and deletes it only if its `outcome` is `contract-check`, answers `{deleted_status}`. Indexer statuses are passed through; a connection or certificate error answers `status` / `deleted_status` null with `error`.\n**Systems changed:** Wazuh indexer, `asox-metrics` test document only (removed by the check).\n**Approval:** not needed: a contract check; it writes only its own test document and removes it.\n**Owner:** n8n (check maintained with the integrator). No error workflow: nothing parks.",
        "height": 440,
        "width": 560
      },
      "id": "74929f66-8fdd-55ab-8eb7-dfd90a751ab5",
      "name": "About this workflow",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -40,
        -500
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "chk-metrics",
        "authentication": "headerAuth",
        "responseMode": "responseNode",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "bf9e4890-6d4f-5c1d-af45-a9f1bdcffee4",
      "name": "Contract check request",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ],
      "webhookId": "763d986e-248a-5728-b4be-b90097da462c",
      "credentials": {
        "httpHeaderAuth": {
          "id": "asoxWebhookToken",
          "name": "ASOX webhook token"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// Validate the request. Only contract-check documents can be written or\n// deleted, so this check can never touch a real alert's document.\nconst body = $input.first().json.body ?? {};\nconst step = body.step;\nconst id = typeof body.id === 'string' ? body.id : '';\nlet error = null;\nif (step !== 'write' && step !== 'delete') error = 'step must be \"write\" or \"delete\"';\nelse if (!/^contract-check-[A-Za-z0-9._:-]{1,113}$/.test(id)) error = 'id must start with \"contract-check-\" (letters, digits, . _ : -; max 128)';\nreturn [{ json: { step, id, error, now: new Date().toISOString() } }];\n"
      },
      "id": "cff7c526-fd19-5964-8685-f6b0e708f5ee",
      "name": "Check input",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        240,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "strict",
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "21f66de6-d75a-529f-ac93-b0d0cb938d40",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.error === null }}",
              "operator": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "operation": "true",
                "singleValue": true
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "92b2dd49-7d2b-55be-9908-dbe2d009842b",
      "name": "Valid?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        480,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "respondWith": "json",
        "responseBody": "={{ { \"status\": null, \"deleted_status\": null, \"error\": $json.error } }}",
        "options": {
          "responseCode": 400
        }
      },
      "id": "7dffb8d1-ec2f-5fdb-841d-47b11c14f2f5",
      "name": "Report invalid",
